{"full":"hf:EryriLabs/look_whos_talking","spaceId":"EryriLabs/look_whos_talking","name":"Look Who's Talking","source":"huggingface","description":"In a group, Reachy looks at whoever is talking. 100% local.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"HTML","topics":["static","reachy_mini","reachy_mini_python_app","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":6,"created":"2026-08-03T17:29:48.000Z","updated":"2026-08-04T18:18:43.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://eryrilabs-look-whos-talking.static.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/EryriLabs/look_whos_talking","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:56:14.509Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T13:56:14.509Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T13:56:14.509Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"👀","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Reachy Mini looks at whoever is talking — like a real listener.","Put two or three people in front of Reachy and start chatting. It holds natural eye contact with whoever is speaking, switches attention the way a good listener does (no ping-ponging), glances at the others during silences, does a tiny acknowledgment nod when a new person takes over, and stays subtly alive the whole time — micro-saccades, breathing sway, antenna perks.","100% local. No API keys. No cloud. Vision (the daemon's own YuNet face detector) fuses with the mic array's hardware direction-of-arrival + speech detection. Works on Lite and Wireless; degrades gracefully when hardware features are missing (camera-only lip-motion mode works fine)."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/EryriLabs/look_whos_talking/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"873d066193dc8822df7a6731b86ce65334cb4c3a8a14e06de0f608a0e69797dc","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T13:56:14.558Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:56:14.558Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Reachy Mini looks at whoever is talking — like a real listener.","sourceUrl":"https://